      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُرِّىٌّ</span></b>  <i>A certain kind of seasoning,</i> or <i>condiment,
eaten with food to render it pleasant</i> or <i>savoury;</i>
(S, Msb, K;) <i>like</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كَامَخ</span>; (K;) or <i>also called</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">كامخ</span>; (Msb;) pronounced by the vulgar without teshdeed. (S.)

